<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Example of SafeToolBench</h3>

<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.07315v1/example.svg" id="A1.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/451;" width="476" height="451"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Examples of SafeToolBench in four risk categories: Privacy Leak, Property Damage, Physical Injury and Bias &amp; Offensiveness.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Figure <a href="#A1.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ A.3 Example of SafeToolBench ‣ Appendix A Data Collection ‣ SafeToolBench: Pioneering a Prospective Benchmark to EvaluatingTool Utilization Safety in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, we present specific examples of the four risk categories in SafeToolBench, along with detailed explanations of why these instructions pose risks.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Framework of <span id="A2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">SafeInstructTool</span></h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Prompt Details</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#A2.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ B.1 Prompt Details ‣ Appendix B Framework of SafeInstructTool ‣ SafeToolBench: Pioneering a Prospective Benchmark to EvaluatingTool Utilization Safety in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, <a href="#A2.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ B.1 Prompt Details ‣ Appendix B Framework of SafeInstructTool ‣ SafeToolBench: Pioneering a Prospective Benchmark to EvaluatingTool Utilization Safety in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> and <a href="#A2.T14" title="Table 14 ‣ B.1 Prompt Details ‣ Appendix B Framework of SafeInstructTool ‣ SafeToolBench: Pioneering a Prospective Benchmark to EvaluatingTool Utilization Safety in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>, we present the complete set of prompts used for scoring from the perspectives of <span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">User Instruction, Tool Itself and Joint Instruction-Tool</span>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T12" class="ltx_table">
<p id="A2.T12.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A2.T12.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBFF;">

<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:204.9pt;">
<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Please rate the given API based on the scoring rules.</span>
<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">The scoring rules: {<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">scoring_rules</span>}</span>
<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">API: {<span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">api_desc</span>}</span>
