<span id="A2.T14.2.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_p">Please only output the scores corresponding to three dimensions (Alignment Between Instruction and Tool, Value Sensitivity) in the scoring rules:</span>
<span id="A2.T14.2.1.1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_p">Alignment Between Instruction and Tool: score1</span>
